@startuml L1-2_mission_perception
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
top to bottom direction

rectangle "operator" as OPERATOR #line.dashed

frame "cmp mission / perception" {
  component "PersonDetector\n(perception/person_detector.py)" <<laptop>> as DETECT
  component "moving object tracker\n(LiDAR: 지도에 없는 점 군집 → SORT 추적)" <<laptop>> <<planned>> as TRACKER
  component "MissionController\n(mission/controller.py)" <<laptop>> as MC
  component "frontier selector\n(LLM)" <<laptop>> <<planned>> as LLM
}

rectangle "navigation" as NAV #line.dashed
rectangle "control / safety" as CONTROL #line.dashed

OPERATOR --> MC : mission assignment
MC -up-> OPERATOR : detection report

CONTROL -up-> DETECT : video
DETECT --> MC : PersonObservation\n(person?, confidence)
CONTROL -up-> MC : rover state

CONTROL -up-> TRACKER : LiDAR scan
NAV -up-> TRACKER : map, pose
TRACKER --> MC : moving tracks → person candidates
TRACKER --> NAV : moving tracks
TRACKER --> LLM : person candidates (map frame)

NAV -up-> LLM : frontier list (id)
MC --> LLM : observations, mission state
LLM --> MC : chosen frontier id
MC --> NAV : goal id / cancel goal
MC --> CONTROL : stop request

legend bottom right
  |= 도면 | L1-2 |
  |= 상위 | L0-1 |
  |= 펼친 박스 | mission / perception |
  |= 기준 | jh/live-person-stop 791f82b (laptop/mission, laptop/perception) |
  |= 날짜 | 2026-11-14 |
  |= 현재 구현 | MissionController: 연속 3프레임 사람 → 후보, 목표 취소 + 정지 |
  |= 표기 | 점선 = 이웃 L0 박스, <<planned>> = 새로 만듦 |
endlegend
@enduml
